---
// 前向 vs 反向传播：前向从输入算出预测与损失；反向从损失用链式法则把梯度传回各层
---
<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 330" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <marker id="bp-fwd" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z" fill="#0e87a6"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker id="bp-back" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z" fill="#d9504f"></path>
      </marker>
      <filter id="bp-shadow" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="160%">
        <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="2" stdDeviation="4" flood-color="#0b2a3a" flood-opacity="0.10"></feDropShadow>
      </filter>
    </defs>
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">
      <text x="300" y="26" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">前向算预测，反向传梯度（链式法则）</text>

      {/* 计算节点链 */}
      {[
        { x: 60,  label: '输入 x',      fill: '#eef2f8', stroke: '#8fa4c9', tc: '#334155' },
        { x: 195, label: '第 1 层 z⁽¹⁾,a⁽¹⁾', fill: '#f0f9fc', stroke: '#7ec3d8', tc: '#0a5f78' },
        { x: 330, label: '第 2 层 z⁽²⁾,a⁽²⁾', fill: '#f0f9fc', stroke: '#7ec3d8', tc: '#0a5f78' },
        { x: 465, label: '预测 ŷ → 损失 L', fill: '#fdf3ec', stroke: '#e6a23c', tc: '#b5791f' },
      ].map((b, i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={b.x} y="96" width="105" height="52" rx="10" fill={b.fill} stroke={b.stroke} stroke-width="1.5" filter="url(#bp-shadow)"></rect>
          <text x={b.x + 52} y="126" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" fill={b.tc} text-anchor="middle">{b.label}</text>
          {i < 3 && (
            <line x1={b.x + 105} y1="118" x2={b.x + 130} y2="118" stroke="#0e87a6" stroke-width="2.2" marker-end="url(#bp-fwd)"></line>
          )}
        </g>
      ))}

      {/* 前向说明 */}
      <text x="300" y="78" font-size="10.5" fill="#0e87a6" text-anchor="middle">前向（forward）：x 一层层算出 ŷ，再与真值比较得到损失 L</text>

      {/* 反向链（红色，位于下方） */}
      {[
        { x: 465 }, { x: 330 }, { x: 195 }, { x: 60 },
      ].map((b, i) => (
        <g>
          {i < 3 && (
            <line x1={b.x} y1="210" x2={b.x - 25} y2="210" stroke="#d9504f" stroke-width="2.2" marker-end="url(#bp-back)"></line>
          )}
        </g>
      ))}
      {[
        { x: 465, label: '∂L/∂ŷ', fill: '#fdeaea', stroke: '#e69a99', tc: '#b14a4a' },
        { x: 330, label: '∂L/∂W⁽²⁾,∂b⁽²⁾', fill: '#fdeaea', stroke: '#e69a99', tc: '#b14a4a' },
        { x: 195, label: '∂L/∂W⁽¹⁾,∂b⁽¹⁾', fill: '#fdeaea', stroke: '#e69a99', tc: '#b14a4a' },
        { x: 60,  label: '更新参数', fill: '#fdeaea', stroke: '#d9504f', tc: '#b14a4a' },
      ].map((b) => (
        <rect x={b.x} y="188" width="105" height="44" rx="10" fill={b.fill} stroke={b.stroke} stroke-width="1.4"></rect>
      ))}
      {[
        { x: 517, t: '∂L/∂ŷ' }, { x: 382, t: '梯度' }, { x: 247, t: '梯度' }, { x: 112, t: '更新' },
      ].map((b) => (
        <text x={b.x} y="214" font-size="10" font-weight="bold" fill="#b14a4a" text-anchor="middle">{b.t}</text>
      ))}

      <text x="300" y="266" font-size="10.5" fill="#b14a4a" text-anchor="middle">反向（backward）：从 L 出发，用链式法则把梯度一路传回每一层的 W、b</text>
      <text x="300" y="292" font-size="10.5" fill="#5b7a86" text-anchor="middle">梯度 = 损失对每个参数的影响；再用优化器按梯度更新参数，让损失下降</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
